#: ../../source/docs/Rover_MAVLink_Messages.rst:5
#: 119835a1eb65479e8b953fdb88d7db1b
msgid "MAVLink Messages"
msgstr "MAVLink 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/Rover_MAVLink_Messages.rst:8
#: d7ca19084d8f4c27a2f362711316adae
msgid ""
"The `MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`_ protocol supports a variety of "
"features and functionalities, but not all `messages "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/>`_ or `commands "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/command.html>`_ are implemented by the "
"ArduPilot ecosystem, or relevant to a particular autopilot firmware."
msgstr ""
"`MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`_ 协议支持多种特性和功能，但并非所有 `消息 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/>`_ 或 `命令 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/command.html>`_ 都已在 ArduPilot "
"生态系统中实现，也不一定与特定飞控固件相关。"

#: ../../source/docs/Rover_MAVLink_Messages.rst:10
#: 0a2cd27cd8c64ac993c0ebd5f0915630
msgid ""
"This page is auto-generated from analysing the Rover source code, and "
"provides an indication of which messages (and commands) are handled by, "
"requestable from, and sent from the firmware. A message being handled does "
"not guarantee full support, but at least shows that the autopilot is aware "
"it exists, and will try to do something meaningful with it."
msgstr ""
"本页面由分析 Rover "
"源代码自动生成，提供了哪些消息（和命令）由固件处理、可向固件请求以及由固件发出的指示。某条消息被处理并不保证完全支持，但至少表明飞控知晓该消息的存在，并会尝试对其进行有意义的处理。"

#: ../../source/docs/Rover_MAVLink_Messages.rst:12
#: 45460b8baabc442e885a317f5944fc62
msgid ""
"Known :ref:`unsupported messages <Rover_mavlink_missing_messages>` (and "
"commands) are shown at the end."
msgstr "已知的 :ref:`不支持消息 <Rover_mavlink_missing_messages>` （和命令）在末尾列出。"

#: ../../source/docs/Rover_MAVLink_Messages.rst:14
#: 172fb6f0fe0f44b3a11d7e36d8de8679
msgid ""
"The autopilot includes a set of :ref:`Rover_mavlink_stream_groups` for "
"convenience, which allow configuring the stream rates of groups of "
"requestable messages by setting parameter values. It is also possible to "
"manually request messages, and request individual messages be streamed at a "
"specified rate."
msgstr ""
"飞控内置了一组 "
":ref:`Rover_mavlink_stream_groups`，方便使用，可通过设置参数值来配置可请求消息组的流速率。也可以手动请求消息，并请求以指定速率流式传输单条消息。"

